        This article describes two debugging aids of the
program \TeX. It primarily focuses on the integer
parameter \cs{tracingcommands} that distinguishes two levels when it
writes information about processed built-in commands into \TeX's log
file. The article also looks at the integer
parameter \cs{tracingmacros}, which is a useful partner
of \cs{tracingcommands}.{\hfuzz=.7pt\par}
